== Review Workflow ==
Review statuses:
'' '''Draft''' — Initial claim draft
'' '''Needs review''' — Ready for review
'' '''Reviewed''' — Approved by reviewer
'' '''Disputed''' — Reviewers disagree
'' '''Archived''' — No longer maintained
Workflow:
= Create claim subobject with required fields =
= Set "Needs review" when sources present =
= Reviewer checks evidence quality =
= Set "Reviewed" or "Disputed" =
= Update last reviewed date and reviewer =
= Increment version on significant changes =
